            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Previewing is a reading strategy that helps readers recall prior knowledge and set a clear purpose for reading by examining text features before detailed reading begins. These features include titles, headings, introductions, and visual elements.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="12770_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Writing questions in the margins during reading describes annotating, the third step in the reading process loop. Previewing takes place before detailed reading begins.</mattext>
