        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="33960_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">An annotating prompt is not a term used in the reading. A growth accelerator prompt is the specific term used to describe an AI prompt that deepens your engagement with a text you have already read.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
    </item>
    <item ident="g22512a145dea0f4b58a1b70cd89cd680" title="Question 4">
      <itemmetadata>
        <qtimetadata>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>question_type</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>multiple_choice_question</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>points_possible</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>1.0</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>original_answer_ids</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>67159,57657,83839,41668</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
        </qtimetadata>
      </itemmetadata>
      <presentation>
        <material>
          <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;What does the prefix &lt;strong&gt;pre&lt;/strong&gt; mean in the word &lt;strong&gt;previewing&lt;/strong&gt;?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
        </material>
        <response_lid ident="response1" rcardinality="Single">
          <render_choice>
            <response_label ident="67159">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">Before</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="57657">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">After</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="83839">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">During</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="41668">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">Again</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
          </render_choice>
        </response_lid>
      </presentation>
      <resprocessing>
        <outcomes>
          <decvar maxvalue="100" minvalue="0" varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal"/>
        </outcomes>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">67159</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="67159_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">57657</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="57657_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">83839</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="83839_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">41668</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="41668_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="No">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">67159</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <setvar action="Set" varname="SCORE">100</setvar>
        </respcondition>
      </resprocessing>
      <itemfeedback ident="67159_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;p&gt;The prefix &lt;em&gt;pre&lt;/em&gt; means &lt;em&gt;before&lt;/em&gt;. Previewing means looking at a text before you read it in detail.&lt;/p&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="57657_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;After&lt;/em&gt; is the opposite of what &lt;em&gt;pre&lt;/em&gt; means. &lt;em&gt;Pre&lt;/em&gt; means &lt;em&gt;before&lt;/em&gt;, which is why previewing happens before detailed reading begins.&lt;/p&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="83839_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;During &lt;/em&gt;does not describe what &lt;em&gt;pre &lt;/em&gt;means. &lt;em&gt;Pre&lt;/em&gt; means &lt;em&gt;before&lt;/em&gt;, which is why previewing happens before detailed reading begins.&lt;/p&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="41668_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Again &lt;/em&gt;is not the meaning of &lt;em&gt;pre&lt;/em&gt;. &lt;em&gt;Pre&lt;/em&gt; means &lt;em&gt;before&lt;/em&gt;, which is why previewing happens before detailed reading begins.&lt;/p&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
    </item>
    <item ident="gd88ba0679cd8d98bca9730ae667fe715" title="Question 40">
      <itemmetadata>
        <qtimetadata>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>question_type</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>multiple_choice_question</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>points_possible</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>1</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>original_answer_ids</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>7294,98404,53673,81874</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
        </qtimetadata>
      </itemmetadata>
      <presentation>
        <material>
          <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;According to the reading, what should you ask yourself before using AI in connection with any reading assignment?&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
        </material>
        <response_lid ident="response1" rcardinality="Single">
          <render_choice>
            <response_label ident="7294">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">Have I engaged with this text myself first?</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="98404">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">Have I written a summary of this text already?</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="53673">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">Have I shared this text with a classmate?</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="81874">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">Have I checked the publication date of this text?</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
          </render_choice>
        </response_lid>
      </presentation>
      <resprocessing>
        <outcomes>
          <decvar maxvalue="100" minvalue="0" varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal"/>
        </outcomes>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">7294</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="7294_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">98404</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="98404_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">53673</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="53673_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">81874</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="81874_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="No">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">7294</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <setvar action="Set" varname="SCORE">100</setvar>
        </respcondition>
      </resprocessing>
      <itemfeedback ident="7294_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">The reading states that before using AI in connection with any reading assignment, you should ask yourself: "Have I engaged with this text myself first?" If the answer is no, you should set the AI tool aside and begin reading on your own.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="98404_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Writing a summary of the text is not the question the reading instructs you to ask before using AI. The key question is whether you have engaged with the text yourself first.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="53673_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Sharing the text with a classmate is not the question the reading instructs you to ask before using AI. The key question is whether you have engaged with the text yourself first.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="81874_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Checking the publication date of the text is part of evaluating a source's currency, not the question you should ask before using AI. The key question is whether you have engaged with the text myself first.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
    </item>
    <item ident="gb9bdd41b1093a05b80f552054d4e6cf6" title="Question 41">
