        </respcondition>
      </resprocessing>
      <itemfeedback ident="46262_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">According to the reading, good writing begins with good reading. Every time you read, you are exposed to someone else's ideas, word choice, vocabulary, and use of language, all of which contribute to your development as a writer.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="13728_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Focusing on grammar instead of ideas is not an effective strategy. The reading specifically states that good writing begins with good reading. Reading exposes you to ideas and language that strengthen your writing.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="54300_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Writing as quickly as possible without revising is not an effective strategy. The reading specifically states that good writing begins with good reading. Reading exposes you to ideas and language that strengthen your writing.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="29732_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Using complex vocabulary can sometimes enhance good writing, but it is not how good writing begins. The reading specifically states that good writing begins with good reading. Reading exposes you to ideas and language that strengthen your writing.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
    </item>
