        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">The reading does not state that becoming a stronger reader guarantees higher grades on every assignment. The specific benefit mentioned is that better reading skills can reduce the time spent on assignments.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="82958_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">The reading does not state that becoming a stronger reader eliminates the need to take notes during class. The specific benefit mentioned is that better reading skills can reduce the time spent on assignments.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="49539_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">The reading specifically states that academic reading requires engaging with a text multiple times, not just once. Becoming a stronger reader improves comprehension and recall, not the ability to read a text only one time.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
    </item>
