        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Active reading means engaging with a text by questioning, annotating, and making connections rather than passively reading through it. This approach improves comprehension and helps you retain information.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="61376_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Reading a text one time without stopping describes passive reading, not active reading. Active reading requires ongoing engagement with the text.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="8987_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Highlighting every sentence does not demonstrate active reading. Active reading requires questioning, annotating, and connecting ideas, not just marking text.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="98646_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Listening to a recorded version of a text is not the same as active reading. Active reading requires your direct engagement with a written text through questioning, annotating, and making connections.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
    </item>
    <item ident="g06fe7edfa2c48828a89fcc7cb91fc945" title="Question 7">
      <itemmetadata>
        <qtimetadata>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>question_type</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>multiple_choice_question</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>points_possible</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>1</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>original_answer_ids</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>59487,87700,19858,98221</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
        </qtimetadata>
      </itemmetadata>
      <presentation>
        <material>
          <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;Which step of the reading process loop involves physically marking up a text and adding notes?&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
        </material>
        <response_lid ident="response1" rcardinality="Single">
          <render_choice>
            <response_label ident="59487">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">Annotating</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="87700">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">Previewing</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="19858">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">Reviewing</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="98221">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">Questioning</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
          </render_choice>
        </response_lid>
      </presentation>
      <resprocessing>
        <outcomes>
          <decvar maxvalue="100" minvalue="0" varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal"/>
        </outcomes>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">59487</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="59487_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">87700</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="87700_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">19858</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="19858_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">98221</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="98221_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="No">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">59487</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <setvar action="Set" varname="SCORE">100</setvar>
        </respcondition>
      </resprocessing>
      <itemfeedback ident="59487_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Annotating is the third step in the reading process loop. It involves physically marking up a text and adding notes, such as writing questions, summarizing ideas, and marking important concepts.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="87700_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Previewing is the first step and focuses on examining text features before reading in detail. It does not involve marking up the text.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="19858_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Reviewing is the fourth step and focuses on reflecting on what you learned after reading. It does not involve marking up the text during reading.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="98221_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">Questioning is the second step and involves thinking critically about the text as you read. Annotating is the step where you physically mark up and add notes to the text.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
    </item>
    <item ident="gcbc47381780dc3c151e655d5df3203c4" title="Question 8">
      <itemmetadata>
        <qtimetadata>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>question_type</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>multiple_choice_question</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>points_possible</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>1</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>original_answer_ids</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>63932,98652,67621,43791</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
        </qtimetadata>
      </itemmetadata>
      <presentation>
        <material>
          <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;Which of the following is an example of a digital annotation tool?&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
        </material>
        <response_lid ident="response1" rcardinality="Single">
          <render_choice>
            <response_label ident="63932">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">A PDF reader with highlighting and note features</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="98652">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">A printed dictionary</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="67621">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">A physical notebook kept separate from the text</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="43791">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">A search engine</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
          </render_choice>
        </response_lid>
      </presentation>
      <resprocessing>
        <outcomes>
          <decvar maxvalue="100" minvalue="0" varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal"/>
        </outcomes>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">63932</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="63932_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">98652</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="98652_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">67621</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="67621_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">43791</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="43791_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="No">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">63932</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <setvar action="Set" varname="SCORE">100</setvar>
        </respcondition>
      </resprocessing>
      <itemfeedback ident="63932_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">PDF readers such as Adobe and Preview have built-in tools that allow you to highlight text and add notes directly to the document. These are examples of digital annotation tools.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="98652_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">A printed dictionary helps with vocabulary but is not an annotation tool. Digital annotation tools are used to mark and add notes directly to a digital text.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="67621_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">A physical notebook kept separate from the text is not a digital annotation tool. Digital annotation tools allow you to add notes directly within the text itself.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="43791_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/plain">A search engine is used to find information online, not to annotate a text. Digital annotation tools are used to mark and add notes directly within a digital document.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
    </item>
    <item ident="g6e542d7092d558f2ea805e330d04db2e" title="Question 9">
      <itemmetadata>
        <qtimetadata>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>question_type</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>multiple_choice_question</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>points_possible</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>1.0</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>original_answer_ids</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>17177,52506,84296,75398</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
        </qtimetadata>
      </itemmetadata>
      <presentation>
        <material>
          <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;What does the term &lt;strong&gt;hallucination&lt;/strong&gt; mean when applied to AI tools?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
        </material>
        <response_lid ident="response1" rcardinality="Single">
          <render_choice>
            <response_label ident="17177">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">When AI generates confident-sounding information that is fabricated</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="52506">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">When AI correctly identifies a source's publication date</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="84296">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">When AI refuses to answer a question</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="75398">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">When AI summarizes a text too briefly</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
          </render_choice>
        </response_lid>
      </presentation>
      <resprocessing>
        <outcomes>
          <decvar maxvalue="100" minvalue="0" varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal"/>
        </outcomes>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">17177</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="17177_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">52506</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="52506_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">84296</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="84296_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">75398</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="75398_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="No">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">17177</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <setvar action="Set" varname="SCORE">100</setvar>
        </respcondition>
      </resprocessing>
      <itemfeedback ident="17177_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">In the context of AI tools, a hallucination occurs when an AI generates confident-sounding information that is fabricated or does not exist. This can include false sources, authors, or research findings.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="52506_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">Correctly identifying a publication date describes accurate AI output, not a hallucination. A hallucination is when AI produces information that sounds accurate but is fabricated.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="84296_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">Refusing to answer a question is not a hallucination. A hallucination is when AI produces information that sounds accurate but is fabricated.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="75398_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">Summarizing a text too briefly describes an incomplete response, not a hallucination. A hallucination is when AI produces information that sounds accurate but is fabricated.</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
    </item>
  </objectbank>
</questestinterop>
